WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.950
- So, you've been performing for so long,

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:04.190
what were some of your
earliest paid roles?

00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:05.730
I always find those interesting.

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:08.333
- Oh sure, paid, I'm trying to think.

00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:13.333
The first big job, that I joined SAG

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:15.900
was a McDonalds commercial
that never aired

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:18.160
for soft serve ice cream.

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:19.040
- Oh?

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:21.701
- I think I was 10 or
something and I just like,

00:00:21.701 --> 00:00:24.223
licked the cone and then made a face.

00:00:25.126 --> 00:00:26.310
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:26.310 --> 00:00:27.854
And then went.

00:00:27.854 --> 00:00:29.960
It was pretty good, I don't
know why it didn't air.

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:31.220
- Oh my gosh.

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:33.620
- And then, I was outside of Chicago

00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:38.620
so we did a lot of industrials
and PSA's and student films.

00:00:38.621 --> 00:00:41.570
I did an anti-smoking ad

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:46.223
for the Illinois Department of
Public Health when I was 16.

00:00:47.271 --> 00:00:49.050
- I think we actually have a clip of that,

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:51.820
which I'm really excited to
take a look at, personally.

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:52.653
- It's pretty good.

00:00:52.653 --> 00:00:55.120
- Okay let's bunch up
and let these folks by.

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:56.740
It's actually a pretty cool school.

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:58.863
The only rule is everybody's gotta smoke.

00:01:00.546 --> 00:01:01.379
(bell rings)

00:01:01.379 --> 00:01:02.212
Ready?

00:01:02.212 --> 00:01:05.015
Here we got languages and stuff.

00:01:05.015 --> 00:01:07.920
- Yo tengo que fumar.

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:10.635
- Hey Dude, I am smoke.

00:01:10.635 --> 00:01:11.468
- I am smoke.

00:01:13.270 --> 00:01:14.233
That was awesome!

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:17.510
I love your comedic
skills though, early on.

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:19.680
You're young for that, that's amazing.

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:23.963
- My commitment to also,
unflattering makeup.

00:01:23.963 --> 00:01:27.700
They painted my teeth and
drew circles under my eyes

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:30.230
and I was like, well I
have to go out tonight!

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:32.613
Look at me.
(laughing)

